; TAXI NETWORK (Direct Taxi for sweatbox sessions, usage flag 1 = aircraft)
; Gates: G<nn> = civil apron stand, GA1 = GA parking, HP_<twy> = holding point at the stopbar on 08L/26R, HP_08R_C / HP_26L_C = hold short of C on 08R/26L.
; RWY 08R/26L is taxi-only: aircraft taxi along it between C and the A, B, D, E connectors.
; Take-off direction follows the longer runway stretch from the hold: HP_D, HP_E -> 08L; HP_C, HP_B, HP_A -> 26R.
; Names: X/n = part of taxiway X, X-Y = connector or stand lead-in.
